  "paths": {
    "/branch/list/1": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Get All Branches",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "Read operation. Retrieve all required pages before reporting complete totals. Returns a paginated list of branches for the account.\n\nThis is a v2 native-entity endpoint served from the `/v2/api/entity` base and authenticated with a Bearer token. **Requires the Branches plugin to be enabled on the account.**\n\nThe trailing path segment (`1`) is the **data level** — how deeply related records are loaded — not a page number. `/branch/list` and `/branch/list/1` return the same result. Pagination is controlled by the `page` and `per_page` query parameters.\n\n| Parameter | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `page` | Page number (default `1`). |\n| `per_page` | Items per page (default `20`). |\n| `filter[<field>][<operator>]` | Filter rows by a field's value, e.g. `filter[status][equal]=1`. |\n| `sort[<field>]` | Sort by a field, `asc` or `desc`, e.g. `sort[code]=asc`. |\n\n**Filterable fields.** Filter with `filter[<field>][<operator>]=<value>`. The fields intended for filtering:\n\n| Field | Type | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| `code` | string | `filter[code][equal]=00001` |\n| `status` | integer (`1`, `2`, `3`) | `filter[status][equal]=1` |\n\n**Sorting.** Sort with `sort[<field>]=asc|desc`, e.g. `sort[code]=asc`. No field is specifically flagged for sorting; the list will in fact filter and sort on any existing column. When no `sort` is given the default ordering is newest first (`id` descending).\n\nThis API exposes six branch fields only — `id`, `name`, `status`, `created`, `modified`, and `code`. Other branch attributes (phone numbers, address, city, state, country, assigned staff, SMTP account, map location) are **not** available through this endpoint.\n\nThe `status` value is one of:\n\n| Value | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `1` | Active |\n| `2` | Inactive |\n| `3` | Suspended |",
        "tags": [
          "Endpoints/Branches "
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "page",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Page number. Defaults to `1`.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "per_page",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Items per page. Defaults to `20`.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "filter[<field>][<operator>]",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Filter rows by a field's value, e.g. `filter[status][equal]=1` or `filter[code][equal]=00001`. Filterable fields intended for use: `code`, `status` (the API also accepts any other existing column).",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "sort[<field>]",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Sort by a field, `asc` or `desc`, e.g. `sort[code]=asc`. Default ordering is `id` descending.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "A paginated list of branches.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "current_page": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "data": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "description": "The branches on this page. Each item is a flat branch record.",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "id": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "description": "Branch id."
                          },
                          "name": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "Branch name."
                          },
                          "status": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "description": "Branch status.\n\n| Value | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Active |\n| 2 | Inactive |\n| 3 | Suspended |",
                            "enum": [
                              1,
                              2,
                              3
                            ]
                          },
                          "created": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "Creation timestamp (`YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS`)."
                          },
                          "modified": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "Last-modified timestamp (`YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS`)."
                          },
                          "code": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "Branch code."
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "id",
                          "name",
                          "status",
                          "created",
                          "modified",
                          "code"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    "first_page_url": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "from": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "nullable": true
                    },
                    "last_page": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "last_page_url": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "links": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "url": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "nullable": true
                          },
                          "label": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "page": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "nullable": true
                          },
                          "active": {
                            "type": "boolean"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "url",
                          "label",
                          "page",
                          "active"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    "next_page_url": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "nullable": true
                    },
                    "path": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "per_page": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "prev_page_url": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "nullable": true
                    },
                    "to": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "nullable": true
                    },
                    "total": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "current_page",
                    "data",
                    "first_page_url",
                    "from",
                    "last_page",
                    "last_page_url",
                    "links",
                    "next_page_url",
                    "path",
                    "per_page",
                    "prev_page_url",
                    "to",
                    "total"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "The Bearer token is missing, invalid, or expired.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "message"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "The authenticated user lacks the permission to manage branches.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "message"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "DaftraConnection": []
          }
        ],
        "operationId": "get__branch_list",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://example.com/v2/api/entity"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/branch": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Edit Branch",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "MUTATING operation. Verify target and authorized intent; reconcile outcome before retry. Updates an existing branch. This posts to the same `/v2/api/entity/branch` path as create; the record to update is identified by the **`id` in the request body**. If `id` is omitted a new branch is created instead.\n\nThis is a v2 native-entity endpoint served from the `/v2/api/entity` base and authenticated with a Bearer token. **Requires the Branches plugin to be enabled on the account.**\n\n**This is a partial merge, not a full overwrite.** Only the fields you include in the body are changed; any field you omit is left untouched. The updatable fields are `name`, `code`, and `status`. Only these fields can be updated — `id`, `name`, `status`, `created`, `modified`, and `code`. Other branch attributes (phone numbers, address, city, state, country, assigned staff, SMTP account, map location) are **not** available through this endpoint.\n\nOn success the response is `{ \"message\": <localized text>, \"id\": <id> }`. The success message is the same text returned by create, so it does not distinguish an update from an insert.\n\nThe `status` value is one of:\n\n| Value | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `1` | Active |\n| `2` | Inactive |\n| `3` | Suspended |",
        "tags": [
          "Endpoints/Branches "
        ],
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "id": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "description": "Id of the branch to update. Required — omitting it creates a new branch instead."
                  },
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Branch name. Optional; only the fields you send are changed."
                  },
                  "code": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Branch code. Optional; only the fields you send are changed."
                  },
                  "status": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "description": "Branch status. Optional; only the fields you send are changed.\n\n| Value | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Active |\n| 2 | Inactive |\n| 3 | Suspended |",
                    "enum": [
                      1,
                      2,
                      3
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "id"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The branch was updated.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "Localized success message (identical to the create message)."
                    },
                    "id": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "description": "Id of the updated branch."
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "message",
                    "id"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "The update could not be saved (for example a database constraint was violated).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "e": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "description": "Error detail. For a database-constraint failure: `{errorInfo, connectionName, readWriteType}`."
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "Human-readable failure reason."
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "message",
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "The Bearer token is missing, invalid, or expired.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "message"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "The authenticated user lacks the permission to manage branches.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "message"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "DaftraConnection": []
          }
        ],
        "operationId": "post__branch",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://example.com/v2/api/entity"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/delete/branch/{id}": {
      "delete": {
        "summary": "Delete Branch",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "MUTATING operation. Verify target and authorized intent; reconcile outcome before retry. Deletes a branch by id.\n\nThis is a v2 native-entity endpoint served from the `/v2/api/entity` base and authenticated with a Bearer token. **Requires the Branches plugin to be enabled on the account.**\n\nThe branch id is given in the path. On success the response is `{ \"message\": <localized text> }`.",
        "tags": [
          "Endpoints/Branches "
        ],
        "parameters": [
